        "original_id": "70b1efd4-5ce8-5568-953d-9f5e734eb022",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"One Dance\", \"Do You Mind\", \"Should've Been Me\", \"Views\"\n- People: Drake, DJ Maphorisa, Kyla, Naughty Boy, Popcaan\n- Roles: Canadian rapper, South African record producer, disk jockey, British singer, British record producer\n\nFacts:\n- DJ Maphorisa, whose real name is Themba Sekowe, was born in 1988 and is a South African record producer and disk jockey who sometimes provides vocals on songs.\n- Drake is a Canadian rapper.\n- Kyla is a British singer best known for her song \"Do You Mind\".\n- \"Do You Mind\" became one of the most successful charting UK funky songs.\n- \"One Dance\" is a song by Drake from his 2016 fourth studio album, \"Views\".\n- Kyla's song \"Do You Mind\" was later featured on Drake's 2016 international hit \"One Dance\".\n- \"Should've Been Me\" is a song by British record producer Naughty Boy featuring vocals from Kyla and Popcaan.",
